        "TileImage": "$($repository 24ea2145-cd9a-4339-a837-26d482bf356d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rA group of local entrepreneurs has been meeting regularly in Sapienza to discuss business opportunities. Unfortunately, their definition of &quot;business&quot; differs significantly from everyone else&apos;s.\r\rBetween villa security, questionable partnerships, and a man named Claudio Spaghetti somehow ending up in charge of important decisions, the situation has become increasingly difficult to take seriously.\r\rEnjoy the Italian coast and diritti d&apos;autore, 47.\r\r-Twiice",
